### 1. Persistent Runner State & FastAPI Lifespan Auto-Resume (`ema_vwap-xh2.1`)
- Stored `paper_runner_enabled` and `paper_polling_interval` in SQLite `system_settings`.
- Added `@asynccontextmanager async def lifespan(app: FastAPI)` in [`src/app.py`](file:///c:/crypto/ema_vwap/src/app.py) to automatically resume live polling when the server boots up and cleanly terminate threads on shutdown.

### 2. Downtime Historical Gap Reconciliation & SL/TP Backfill (`ema_vwap-xh2.2`)
- Implemented `reconcile_positions_on_startup()` in [`src/paper/engine.py`](file:///c:/crypto/ema_vwap/src/paper/engine.py) to audit open positions against candles elapsed during offline downtime.
- Identifies and executes Stop-Loss/Take-Profit triggers at the exact historical downtime timestamp, recording completed trades and updating ledger balances before resuming live polling.
- Added `POST /api/paper/engine/reconcile` for on-demand reconciliation.

